[[File:Official_New_United_States_of_America_Flag_2.png|thumb|Concept Flag SR USA]]Just a proposed design. The star in the middle represents the federal government. The 13 stars can either represent the original 13 colonies, or eventually 13 planets or star systems. The downward arrow represents America's past history, particularly on Earth. The arrow pointing upward represents America's aspiring future among the stars. Just an idea.